// P0 — Prologue: Night City (M7.4). Original lines; one short book phrase.
=== start ===
# page:test
the color of television, tuned to a dead channel
* [NIGHT CITY] -> night

=== night ===
# page:text
Chiba. Night City. You hustle the Chatsubo and call it living. The meat is a prison.
* [LINDA] -> linda

=== linda ===
# page:text
Linda takes the Hitachi RAM. Later, Deane's ginger. She does not come back.
* [THE COFFIN] -> molly

=== molly ===
# page:text
Cheap Hotel. A razorgirl waits in your coffin, lenses mirrored, fletcher on the sheet.
* [THE HILTON] -> armitage

=== armitage ===
# page:text
Armitage at the Chiba Hilton. A job. New pancreas. Liver plugs, so you cannot get high.
* [SURGERY] -> surgery

=== surgery ===
# page:text
Nerves restored. Fifteen toxin sacs as leverage. The deck is warm. Time to jack in.
* [JACK IN] -> END
